  "doctrine": [],
  "note": "Judges 15 plays on the shared sound of the place name and the common noun. The narrative already calls the site Lehi before Samson finds the bone and explicitly connects his act with the longer name Ramath-lehi. The ancient name of the settlement before this episode is uncertain."
